# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Dashboard environment. Copy to `.env.local` — it is git-ignored.
#
# Nothing in this file is a secret. `VITE_`-prefixed variables are inlined into
# the bundle and are therefore public; the API key below is deliberately NOT
# prefixed, because it is read by the Vite dev server, not the browser.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Fixture mode (the default): leave this line commented to browse the
# illustrative dataset. Every screen then says "Fixtures · illustrative data".
#
# Live mode: uncomment it. An empty value means "same origin", which is what the
# dev proxy below provides — the browser calls /api/... and Vite forwards it.
# VITE_API_URL=

# Where the dev/preview server proxies /api and /health. Defaults to the API's
# own default address, so you only need this if you run the API elsewhere.
# VITE_API_PROXY_TARGET=http://127.0.0.1:8787

# Dev-server only: injected as `Authorization: Bearer …` on proxied /api calls,
# so you can run the API with AEROSCRIBE_API_KEY set without putting the key in
# the browser. Because it has no VITE_ prefix, Vite never inlines it.
# AEROSCRIBE_API_KEY=
